{"availability":"available","full":"ahochsteger/gmail-processor","name":"gmail-processor","description":"Gmail Processor is a Google Apps Script library that automates the processing of Gmail messages and attachments and execute actions (e.g. store attachments in a GDrive folder, log information in a spreadsheet) depending on matching criteria.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":587,"forks":143,"created":"2013-02-10T21:23:01Z","updated":"2026-10-10T01:11:07Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"http://ahochsteger.github.io/gmail-processor/","topics":["automation","gmail","script"],"demo":"https://ahochsteger.github.io/gmail-processor/playground","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:31.318Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:31.318Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:31.318Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T09:01:31.318Z","stars":587,"forks":143}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( []( [](#contributors) [](CODEOFCONDUCT.md)","Gmail Processor is an open-source Google Apps Script library that automates the processing of Gmail messages and attachments by executing actions (e.g. store attachments in a GDrive folder, log information into a spreadsheet) depending on powerful matching criteria.","Gmail Processor is the successor of Gmail2GDrive with vastly enhanced functionality, completely re-written in TypeScript with extensibility and stability in mind, using a modern development setup and automation all over the place (dependency updates, tests, documentation, releases, deployments). There's a convenient migration available to convert your old configuration to the new format (see Migrating from GMail2GDrive)."],"features":["🤖 Extensive Automation: Automate email processing using the provided configuration to match threads, messages, and attachments, and trigger actions accordingly.","📁 Google Drive Integration: Store files such as attachments, PDFs of messages, or entire threads into any location within Google Drive, providing easy organization and accessibility.","🔒 PDF Decryption: Decrypt password-protected PDFs attached to emails and store them.","✂️ OCR Text Extraction: Extract text (e.g. invoice number) from attached documents (JPEG, PNG, GIF, PDF) to organize and annotate your attachments.","📄 Google Spreadsheet Logging: Keep track of processed threads, messages, and attachments by logging valuable information into a Google Spreadsheet."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ahochsteger/gmail-processor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"42c17dda434f09148264fbcf263ed84df0c0c60d1b016b8371d0addfafe9b42a","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:31.401Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:31.401Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[]( []( [](#contributors) [](CODEOFCONDUCT.md)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ahochsteger/gmail-processor/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"42c17dda434f09148264fbcf263ed84df0c0c60d1b016b8371d0addfafe9b42a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ahochsteger/gmail-processor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:31.402Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T01:11:07Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ahochsteger/gmail-processor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:31.402Z","hash":"42c17dda434f09148264fbcf263ed84df0c0c60d1b016b8371d0addfafe9b42a","originalBytes":16202,"storedBytes":16202,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["github","gmail","processor","code","google","actions","attachments","configuration","contributors","guide","messages","vulnerabilities","automation","bugs","development","information","issues","license","new","processing","pull","store","threads","using","any","apps","attached","automate","automated","branch","closed","config","date","dependencies","documentation","drive","e.g.","email","examples","extensibility","features","filter","get","getting","gmail2gdrive","integration","